{
  "id": 337799374,
  "iid": 17833,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "wsutil: Use universal character escapes for UTF-8 entity strings",
  "description": "Instead of specifying our Unicode characters with numeric escape\nsequences representing bytes, using the universal character name\nescapes (\\unnnn, since all ours are in the Basic Multilingual Plane.)\n    \nThis means that these string can be freely concatenated with UTF-16\nand UTF-32 string literals and still work properly. UTF-16 is used\ninternally by Qt and can be introduced by some macros, such as those\nused with QStringLiteral.\n\nThis should prevent accidentally introducing mojibake as with\ncommit 540133b65944bcbd337e10fec246e8f1a48d683a",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2024-10-29T11:37:50.455Z",
  "updated_at": "2024-10-30T01:29:20.355Z",
